Function-word lists for BookLoom
================================

Source: stopwords-iso (https://github.com/stopwords-iso), one repository per language, "stopwords-<lang>", file
stopwords-<lang>.txt on the master branch, downloaded 2026-10-29. Languages: en uk ru de es fr pl cs sk hr sl pt.
Commits used: en ccc8898188, uk 83b24b92ff, ru e1779aae6f, de d3826f11cd, es 622c17231f, fr 069f556be8, pl 723fe9b896,
cs e93e103f19, sk bd3c61983b, hr 56d5bfcc64, sl 5474e42f16, pt 84249b7ca3.

