Changes: each list was trimmed to function words (articles, prepositions, conjunctions, pronouns, particles,
auxiliaries); content words were removed, and English "may" and "will" because they are also first names the name scan must not treat as stop words. The uk and ru lists were rewritten from the source list and extended with
function words the source lacks. A word both Russian and Ukrainian use is in uk.txt, because it is a Ukrainian word.
